@startuml F7.2-D04-salvar-matriz
title F7.2-D04 — Salvar matriz role × authority
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "IAMController" as Ctrl
participant "UpdateRoleAuthoritiesUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres
participant "CapabilityCache" as Cache

Admin -> WebApp: Salvar matriz
WebApp -> Jwt: PATCH /admin/perfis/{id}/authorities
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: delta add/remove\n+ audit_log
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC -> Cache: invalidate perfil
Cache --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Admin: matriz atualizada

@enduml
